Redface 2 v0.43.0 — beta.

Private conversations finally read like topics.

- Pinch zoom, page swipe, double-tap to refresh.
- The topic pagination chrome: page picker, floating buttons, long press for the first or last page.
- The reading position of each page is restored when you come back to it.
- Quote several messages at once, with a button on every card.
- A message's menu opens from the header "...".
- New: keep conversations cached on the device, off by default.
